  "identifier": "virchow2",
  "name": "Virchow2",
  "description": "Second-generation Virchow pathology foundation model — ViT-H/14 (632M parameters) pretrained on 3.1M whole-slide images from Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center at multiple magnifications (5×, 10×, 20×, 40×). Doubles training data and adds multi-magnification pretraining over the original Virchow. 91k+ monthly HuggingFace downloads. Paige + Microsoft Research, arXiv 2024. Note: licence changed from Virchow's Apache 2.0 to CC-BY-NC-ND 4.0 — non-commercial and academic use only. Institutional email and individual registration required.",
