  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The most-downloaded Paige pathology FM (91k+ monthly downloads) with 3.1M slides and multi-magnification pretraining — technically superior to the original Virchow. However, Paige downgraded the licence from Apache 2.0 to CC-BY-NC-ND 4.0 for this version, restricting commercial and derivative use. Teams with commercial pipelines should use Virchow (Apache 2.0) or Prov-GigaPath (Apache 2.0) instead. Assess for academic research.",
